about the centre of the triangular tiling.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ebeea441-6c6f-48c4-bf63-7a24cdcb00cb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
