  "45e679f5-d654-446d-94ca-be514a6fe1b6"],
 ", cannot be drawn; without the option it is drawn at a planar layout. The \
translation of the square torus by one step:"
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"892b90f8-5045-4af5-a063-f5a500156972"],

